    "title": "Penn State Battling Familiar Face for QB Will Wood as Decision Nears - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Joe Smeltzer ,\n17 hours ago Penn State wants Will Wood, and will have to beat out a beloved figure in program history to get him. In an interview with NSN conducted minutes after Wood had a phone call with PSU coach Matt Campbell that went roughly 40 minutes, Wood said that, while there are other schools he’s considering, Penn State and Boston College are the co-favorites. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
